{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22151","headline":"闲居 · 白居易","name":"闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空腹一醆粥，饥食有余味。\n南檐半牀日，暖卧因成睡。\n緜袍拥两膝，竹几支双臂。\n从旦直至昏，身心一无事。\n心足即爲富，身闲乃当贵。\n富贵在此中，何必居高位。\n君看裴相国，金紫光照地。\n心苦头尽白，才年四十四。\n乃知高盖车，乘者多忧畏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}